@startuml Germany_Speed_Limits
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

title Germany — Speed Limits, Weight Thresholds & Licence Classes (StVO)

start

:Vehicle to be driven on German roads;

if (Is a trailer attached? (Gespann)) then (YES)

  if (Combined total weight ≤ 3.5 t?) then (YES — light combination)
    if (Tempo-100 certification sticker present?) then (YES)
      #LightGreen:**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 100 km/h**
      Applies to: Cars / Trucks ≤ 3.5 t / Motorhomes ≤ 3.5 t + trailer;
    else (NO)
      :**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 80 km/h**
      Applies to: Cars / Trucks ≤ 3.5 t / Motorhomes ≤ 3.5 t + trailer;
    endif
  else (NO — towing vehicle > 3.5 t)
    :**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 60 km/h | Autobahn: 80 km/h**
    Applies to: Trucks > 3.5 t / Motorhomes > 3.5 t / Buses + trailer;
  endif

else (NO — single vehicle)

  if (Vehicle weight > 7.5 t?) then (YES)
    #Pink:**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 60 km/h | Autobahn: 60 km/h**
    Any vehicle over 7.5 t
    Sunday driving ban applies to commercial trucks;
  else (NO — weight ≤ 7.5 t)
    if (Vehicle type?) then (Truck / Lkw  3.5 t – 7.5 t)
      :**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 80 km/h**;
    elseif (Motorhome  3.5 t – 7.5 t) then
      :**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 100 km/h**;
    elseif (Bus — no standing passengers) then
      if (Certified for 100 km/h?) then (YES)
        :#LightGreen:**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 100 km/h**;
      else (NO)
        :**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 80 km/h | Autobahn: 80 km/h**;
      endif
    else (Car / Motorbike / Truck / Motorhome ≤ 3.5 t)
      #LightGreen:**Urban: 50 km/h | Rural: 100 km/h | Autobahn: 130 km/h***
      *Recommended only — no general motorway limit unless posted;
    endif
  endif

endif

stop

legend right
  **Speed Limits at a Glance (Urban / Rural / Autobahn)**
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SINGLE VEHICLES (no trailer)
  Cars / Motorbikes / Trucks / Motorhomes ≤ 3.5 t:    50 / 100 / 130* km/h
  Motorhomes 3.5 t – 7.5 t:                           50 /  80 / 100  km/h
  Trucks (Lkw) 3.5 t – 7.5 t:                         50 /  80 /  80  km/h
  Buses (no standing passengers, standard):            50 /  80 /  80  km/h
  Buses (certified):                                   50 /  80 / 100  km/h
  Any vehicle > 7.5 t:                                 50 /  60 /  60  km/h
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  TRAILERS — Gespanne
  Combined ≤ 3.5 t (standard):                         50 /  80 /  80  km/h
  Combined ≤ 3.5 t (Tempo-100 certified):              50 /  80 / 100  km/h
  Towing vehicle > 3.5 t with trailer:                 50 /  60 /  80  km/h
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  * Recommended only — no general Autobahn speed limit in Germany
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  TEMPO-100 WEIGHT RATIOS (max trailer = car empty weight × factor)
  Unbraked / braked without shock absorbers:    × 0.3
  Braked with shock absorbers:                  × 1.1
  Caravan + shock absorbers + anti-sway device: × 1.2
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  CRITICAL WEIGHT THRESHOLDS
  3,500 kg: Divides standard from heavy vehicle rules (licence, speed, overtaking)
  7,500 kg: Triggers Sunday driving ban + strict rural/motorway speed limits
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  LICENCE CLASSES
  Class B:   Vehicle ≤ 3,500 kg | Trailer ≤ 750 kg OR combined ≤ 3,500 kg
  Class B96: Vehicle ≤ 3,500 kg | Combined 3,500 kg to 4,250 kg
  Class BE:  Vehicle ≤ 3,500 kg | Trailer ≤ 3,500 kg | Combined ≤ 7,000 kg
endlegend

@enduml
